er wie möglich.","ar":"أبقِ غرفتك نظيفةً بقدر الإمكان."},{"t":"Die Liebe ist das Wunder der Zivilisation.","ar":"الحب هو معجزة المدنيّة."},{"t":"Ich koche nicht gerne, wenn es draußen heiß ist.","ar":"لا أحب أن أطبخ عندما يكون الجو حارّاً."},{"t":"„Von wem sind diese Dokumente?“ — „Sie sind von Michael.“","ar":"\"لمن هذه الوثائق؟\" \"إنها لمايكل.\""}],"focus":["koche","Zivilisation","haltet","starker","weggegangen","eindeutig","Heimweh","hinzugefügt","Michael","johann"],"words":[{"word":"Zivilisation","topic":"L347","difficulty":5,"meaning":"حَضَارَة","example":"Die Liebe ist das Wunder der Zivilisation.","translation":"الحب هو معجزة المدنيّة."},{"word":"eindeutig","topic":"L347","difficulty":5,"meaning":"وَاضِح"},{"word":"Heimweh","topic":"L347","difficulty":5,"meaning":"حَنِين","example":"Er hat wohl Heimweh.","translation":"لا بد أنه مشتاق إلى بيته."},{"word":"Michael","topic":"L347","difficulty":5,"meaning":"مِيكَائِيل","example":"Michael Jackson ist gestorben.","translation":"توفي مايكل جاكسون."},{"word":"johann","topic":"L347","difficulty":5,"meaning":"يُوحَنَّا"}],"difficulty":5}}